WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.816
Naaba Wobgo ne yʋʋmd 1896 kɩɩsgã.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.900
Yʋʋm kobs 19 wã saabẽ, a Ouagadougou ra yaa Mozi soolmã tẽn-kãsengã.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.760
A Buukary Koutou sẽn wa n yaa rĩmã, a pʋdame t'a Naaba Wobgo.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.432
Yʋʋmd 1894 wã, a sigla taab ne Britãnsã tʋm-tʋmd a George Ekem Ferguson.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.944
A Frans nebã kɩɩsame, bala bãmb me rat n dɩka tẽn-kãnga.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.576
Yʋʋmd 1896 wã, Paul Voulet ne a Julien Chanoine sull n kẽnga Mossi tẽngẽ.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.120
A Naaba Wobgo sẽn modgd n na n tõoge, b yõoga a tẽngã bugum.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.096
A Voulet rɩka Ouagadougou.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.904
Yʋʋmd 1897 wã, a Voulet kɩtame t'a saam-biig a Sighiri lʋɩ a naamã.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.900
A Naaba Wobgo kosa Britani wã tɩ b sõng-a, n pa tõog ye.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.448
A zoe n kẽnga Gold Coast, sẽn yaa Ghana rũndã-rũndã wã.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:25.794
Sẽn yɩɩd fãa, b pa sak n deeg bũmb nins fãa a sẽn yeelã ye. Yaa sɩd t'a goamã ket n yaa sɩda.
